    "author": "GudTree Editorial Team",
    "authorRole": "Plant Nutrition Researchers",
    "authorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=300",
    "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Chickpea_BNC.jpg/1280px-Chickpea_BNC.jpg",
    "readTime": "3 min read",
    "excerpt": "Party ke agle din subah sir phat raha hai aur gala sookha hai? Chai ya coffee chhod kar ye 3 desi drinks pijiye jo liver aur electrolytes turant reset karein.",
    "content": "<p>Party ya dosto ke sath chill karne ke agle din subah jab aankh khulti hai, toh sabse pehli cheez jo mehsoos hoti hai: sir me hathode jaisa dard, gala ret (sand) ki tarah sookha hua, aur pet me ajeeb si ulti jaisi jalan. Ise bolte hain alcohol dehydration aur toxic acetaldehyde buildup.</p>\n<p>Zyadatar log galti kya karte hain? Subah uthte hi kadak adrak wali chai ya black coffee mangwate hain. Par coffee aur chai body ko aur zyada sukha deti hai aur pehle se dukhti hui acidity ko badha deti hai.</p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>GudTree Golden Rule:</strong> Hangover koi bimari nahi hai, ye sharir me pani aur minerals (electrolytes) ki bheed-bhad me kami hai. Isko theek karne ka rasta liver ko hydrate karna hai, caffeine se shock dena nahi.</p></blockquote>\n\n<h2>Hangover Ke Waqt Sharir Me Kya Hota Hai?</h2>\n<p>Jab aap daru peete hain, toh kidney har 1 peg ke badle 4 guna zyada pani peshab ke raste bahar nikal deti hai. Iske sath potassium, sodium aur magnesium bahar beh jate hain. Yahi wajah hai ki subah dimaag ki nasen khichne lagti hain aur chakkar aane lagta hai.</p>\n\n<h2>3 Desi Gharelu Drinks Jo 30 Minute Me Asar Dikhayein</h2>\n\n<h3>1. Taaza Nariyal Pani + 1 Chutki Sendha Namak</h3>\n<p>Ye duniya ka sabse powerful natural electrolyte hai. Isme market ke kisi bhi sports drink se 4 guna zyada potassium hota hai jo sharir ki har cell me pani wapas kheench leta hai. Ek chutki sendha namak milane se sodium level turant normal hota hai aur sir ka dard 20 minute me kam ho jata hai.</p>\n\n<h3>2. Kacha Nimbu-Pani + Bhuna Jeera + 1 Chammach Gud (Jaggery)</h3>\n<p>Chini ke badle thoda sa pighla hua kala gud ya honey gholein. Gud me natural fructose hota hai jo liver ko alcohol jaldi todne (metabolize karne) me fuel deta hai. Nimbu vitamin C deta hai aur bhuna jeera pet ki ulti jaisi feeling ko shant karta hai.</p>\n\n<h3>3. Thandi Patli Jeera Chaas (Buttermilk)</h3>\n<p>Agar subah seene me jalan ho rahi hai aur khana dekhne ka mann nahi kar raha, toh 1 glass taaza dahi ko khoob saare pani ke sath math lijiye (blend karein). Thoda kala namak aur pudina daalein. Dahi ke natural probiotics pet ki aanto par protective layer bana dete hain.</p>\n\n<h2>Hangover Subah Kya BILKUL Na Karein?</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Khali Pet Paracetamol Mat Lein:</strong> Alcohol todte waqt liver pehle hi thaka hota hai. Paracetamol liver par bhari stress dalta hai.</li>\n  <li><strong>Doodh Wali Kadak Chai:</strong> Khali pet chai peene se acid reflux hota hai aur ulti turant bahar aa sakti hai.</li>\n  <li><strong>Heavy Fried Nashta:</strong> Poori-bhaji ya greasy burger khane se liver ko extra tel pachan me lagna padta hai. Poha ya khichdi jaisa halka khayein.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Hangover Reset Speed Chart</h2>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Subah Ka Drink</th>\n      <th>30 Min Baad Ka Asar</th>\n      <th>Kisko Lena Chahiye</th>\n      <th>Kharche</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Nariyal Pani + Sendha Namak</td>\n      <td>Sir dard gayab, energy wapas</td>\n      <td>Jiska gala sookha ho aur sir phat raha ho</td>\n      <td>₹60</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Nimbu-Pani + Gud + Jeera</td>\n      <td>Liver fast detox, ulti shant</td>\n      <td>Jisko pet me marod aur weakness lage</td>\n      <td>₹5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Taaza Thandi Jeera Chaas</td>\n      <td>Acidity khatam, pet thanda</td>\n      <td>Jisko seene me jalan aur dast lage</td>\n      <td>₹10</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Agli baar party ke baad subah mehengi dawa lene ke bajay kitchen me jaiye aur ye desi sharbat pijiye. Sharir khud b khud normal rhythm me laut aayega.</p>",
